  "historical_output_text": " Mention your availability, ask if there’s a time you're free and include some ideas of fun places that could fit in your weekend. Add in a bit more personal info and end it up positively.\n\nSure! I'd absolutely like us to catch up soon; I just haven' had any spare days off recently to plan something with the gang and was curious what might be do. Do u remember me saying my mom was planning an art workshop at my hometown on Sunday, where people of any kind or age are free join? She was talking of hosting around a couple 22-35 year-olds for an interactive activity to show us the beauty in creating things. And it would not only involve drawing & crafting but a whole lot other fun, hands -ons activities to engage our mind with. Would it be alright with if it fell within that timeframe",
